            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MouseEvent.movementX</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">MouseEvent.movementY</code> are set on the <code class=\"notranslate\">mousemove</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">pointermove</code> event in all browsers per the spec <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/pointerlock/#extensions-to-the-mouseevent-interface\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/pointerlock/#extensions-to-the-mouseevent-interface</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome interpretted the spec to mean that <code class=\"notranslate\">pointerrawupdate</code> should also cause those properties to be updated on movement (it came after the spec was written) while FF140 (first version) did not. There are PRs to clarify the spec in this respect.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">FF148 now updates  <code class=\"notranslate\">pointerrawupdate</code> to also populate those values on movement in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1987671\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1987671</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Anyway, what I have done is treated the original FF implementation of <code class=\"notranslate\">pointerrawupdate</code>  as a partial implementation that will be fixed in FF148. That is the cleanest way of capturing a compatibiliy difference that only exists for 8 releases (I could have put this on the <code class=\"notranslate\">movementX</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">Y</code> in some way, but that would probably be more complicated.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3805422493\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42752\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42752/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42752\">mdn/content#42752</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28920",
            "title": "FF148 Element.pointerrawupdate event - supports movementX/Y properties",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-27T05:54:04.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-27T05:40:59.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add Firefox notes for <code class=\"notranslate\">CSSStyleSheet.replace()</code>, mentioning a bug that affecting Firefox 120 and earlier.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #21259.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1997528441\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21259\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21259/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21259\">#21259</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28919",
            "title": "Add Firefox notes for `CSSStyleSheet.replace()`",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-26T17:30:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-26T17:29:22.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update Firefox/Safari statements for <code class=\"notranslate\">InstallEvent</code> interface.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Both \"only\" support the <code class=\"notranslate\">install</code> event, but it is of type <code class=\"notranslate\">ExtendableEvent</code>, not <code class=\"notranslate\">InstallEvent</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Opened <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3856748038\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/issues/3020\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/3020/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/3020\">openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector#3020</a> to update the collector test.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #22591.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2177917062\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22591\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22591/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22591\">#22591</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28918",
            "title": "Firefox/Safari don't support `InstallEvent` interface",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-26T22:17:03.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-26T16:58:49.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/755354?u=7e7c1abdb78aea9b0b6b14e40544503f72b34789&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Follow up to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3616074591\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28438\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28438/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28438\">#28438</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 146 added the flag, but the implementation was broken until 148 when <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2004653\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2004653</a> landed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The incorrect number here just tripped me up. I verified with the following demo: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/play?id=U8cvGsg%2BDaBm2AFnvIIk%2ByYP1LeLiLE5PiRV%2FdPMAPqVXjdJQJQT4sKK4rGFsaaMrx7IrMR9kfaXdnns\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/play?id=U8cvGsg%2BDaBm2AFnvIIk%2ByYP1LeLiLE5PiRV%2FdPMAPqVXjdJQJQT4sKK4rGFsaaMrx7IrMR9kfaXdnns</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It shows red (i.e. no <code class=\"notranslate\">@custom-media</code> support) on Firefox 146 and 147, and shows blue in 148.</p>",
