        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Refine Firefox support data for HTML datalist element:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Mention that the color type is not supported (unlike what <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2486850247\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24225\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24225/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24225\">#24225</a> stated).</li>\n<li>Merge the partial statements, splitting up the note, mentioning versions and bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #22630.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2187331508\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22630\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22630/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22630\">#22630</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relevant for <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3513693319\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28189\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28189/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28189\">#28189</a>, which I will need to update.</p>",
